- remove or change this license or any copyright notice in the Action.

3. Your code and data
The Action reads your pull request and the rules file you commit, and posts comments through the GitHub API. It sends nothing to Creste. Your code, your pull requests and your rules file stay yours, and we claim no rights in them.

4. Ownership
Creste owns the Action and all rights in it. This license gives you only the rights in section 1.

